    "detailed_description": "Payasos &amp; Balazos is a 2D action-platformer focused on boss battles, with a strong emphasis on comedy. Help Chicl\u00f3n, a freshly graduated clown, become the star of Circo Domingo and uncover the secrets of the mysterious Laughland Island.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nArm yourself with your bubblegum blaster, dodge explosive pies, jump across treacherous platforms, and face off against enemies with outrageous wigs and way too much makeup.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83c\udfaaKey Features:<br />\r\nIntense boss battles with unique and extravagant personalities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA colorful, exaggerated art style inspired by cartoons and circus aesthetics.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChallenging platforming with arcade-inspired mechanics and a wide variety of enemies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAbsurd humor, funny dialogues, and ridiculously chaotic situations.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOriginal soundtrack blending rock, circus music, and pure chaos.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDo you have what it takes to survive the most dangerous circus in the world?<br />\r\nIt\u2019s time to kick some red-nosed butt!",
    "about_the_game": "Payasos &amp; Balazos is a 2D action-platformer focused on boss battles, with a strong emphasis on comedy. Help Chicl\u00f3n, a freshly graduated clown, become the star of Circo Domingo and uncover the secrets of the mysterious Laughland Island.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nArm yourself with your bubblegum blaster, dodge explosive pies, jump across treacherous platforms, and face off against enemies with outrageous wigs and way too much makeup.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83c\udfaaKey Features:<br />\r\nIntense boss battles with unique and extravagant personalities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA colorful, exaggerated art style inspired by cartoons and circus aesthetics.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChallenging platforming with arcade-inspired mechanics and a wide variety of enemies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAbsurd humor, funny dialogues, and ridiculously chaotic situations.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOriginal soundtrack blending rock, circus music, and pure chaos.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDo you have what it takes to survive the most dangerous circus in the world?<br />\r\nIt\u2019s time to kick some red-nosed butt!",
    "short_description": "A 2D action platformer focused on bosses and comedy. Join Chicl\u00f3n and his bubblegum gun on a colorful adventure to rebuild a circus and defeat the fearsome Magnum Risum on the chaotic Laughter Island.",
